  "prefLabel": "Rev 2605.02 Obtaining Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2605.02 Obtaining Forms. Tax forms may be obtained by:\n\n(a) Downloading them at http://www.nh.gov/revenue;\n\n(b) Requesting them by telephone at 603-230-5001;\n\n(c) Writing to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nP.O. Box 637\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0637; or\n\n(d) Requesting them in person at:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nGovernor Hugh Gallen State Office Park\n\n109 Pleasant Street\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\nSource. #7479, eff 4-24-01; ss by #9443, eff 4-1-09; ss by #12138, eff 3-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2600.html"
